  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grid Reliability and Efficiency Event Series, through Tuatara Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting the Grid Reliability and Efficiency Event Series consisting of three subregional reverse trade missions and one workshop. The Event Series will introduce public and private sector delegates from sub-Saharan Africa&apos;s power sector to the latest U.S. technologies, services, and best practices to manage grid networks, reduce power losses, increase efficiency, and integrate energies. The Event Series would also highlight best practices, policies, regulations, and financing mechanisms to facilitate the implementation of resilient grid infrastructure projects across the region.</narrative>
  </description>
